<!-- The Now Bar's placeholder button between sunrise and Zuhr, when there's
     no prayer to log: fully transparent on purpose. One UI prints the
     countdown at full size only on a card that has a button, so one is
     there, but nothing is drawn — One UI tints the glyph SRC_IN and gives
     the button no background of its own, so it takes up its place and
     shows nothing. Tapping it opens the app, like tapping the card. -->
